                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "As you already know from other reviews, the original level loves to crash every 5~ minutes. However, i managed to play through it without any issues after i loaded prior to playing another level before it (i don't know if you have to complete though, i didn't test it). I don't know if this helps the game in some capacity but you managed to get pass this annoying issue the game is worth it. Even if you don't manage to load it without issues, for 40 cents you can play the other levels they made which are newer and better. You don't miss much for not playing the first level other some nostalgia i guess.",
